# Bank Management System – Day09
## Overview
This project is part of my Python Object-Oriented Programming practice.

Day09 extends the previous project by adding:
- Branch Tree Structure
- Recursive Total Balance
- Transfer Graph
- Breadth-First Search (BFS)

## Features
### Account Registry
- Add accounts
- Find account by number
- List all accounts
- Top accounts by balance
- Binary search by account number
- Recursive transaction total

### Branch Tree
- Head Office
- Regional Branches
- Local Branches
- Recursive total balance calculation
### Transfer Graph
- Account transfer connections
- Breadth-First Search (BFS)
- Find all reachable accounts
